# Proxy the live Flask dashboard through rein.argobox.com
# so the whole demo lives under one domain for judges/visitors.
# CF Pages proxying (200 status) is only available on Workers-backed Pages;
# for static Pages, these are 302 redirects to the local API server.
/hermes         https://rein-local.argobox.com/hermes       302
/operator       https://rein-local.argobox.com/operator     302
/triage         /triage.html                                 302
/api/v1/*       https://rein-local.argobox.com/api/v1/:splat  302
